multi-strategy platform focusing on yielding investments and debt financing. The firm provides credit solutions, special situations funding, real estate credit, investment-grade credit, infrastructure yield investments, commercial real estate yield acquisitions, perpetual capital, and energy transition funding. It looks to acquire, operate, and manage infrastructure assets with low counterparty risk, long residual tenures, and low operating costs. The firm also offers co-investment opportunities to its clients through portfolio management services. It manages alternative investment funds and offers both onshore and offshore investment solutions. EAAA India Alternatives Limited, formerly known as Edelweiss Alternative Asset Advisors Limited, is based in Mumbai, India, with additional offices in New Delhi, India; Gandhinagar, India; and Singapore.EAAA India Alternatives Limited operates as the operating subsidiary of Magnolia Commodities Services Private Limited.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1794873600,"asOf":1795529308},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529307,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"EAAA India Alternatives\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"EAAA INDIA ALTERNATIVES L Share Price - Live NSE: EDELALTS Stock Price & Chart","s":"Upstox","d":1795505780,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFBOM2QxUGlRLXAzRzFRZWpuY0o4Q20yamgySXhvSkdPT3pGNE0zWVR1WnNuWGMxMGg0elZUMmJIUUtReGZ6Y29ya3paV2dNZkluaC1DWHZ1V0VlSTBLc21PbXJrZ1F6bElKdFBNX2JSUVg3dw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"EAAA India Alternatives Ltd. Share Price Live Today","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795428000,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNYzFQaEVfU21DZzB0eWZ3Qm9USVNqY2h6NXF4X3NaOHNTdkhNSlFuVkRreDU1QWlmNzY2VHFpN2pVc1RhZmctaHdyUjJrMUVSNWltRTV4RzFzVHEtNjBEVkVKNUNoYVZHaHRDcVkybnRrd0ppY0hIMGp2bmN4MzdPWkFYVFJPSUtEdnhYbV9pUQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"SAM Advises EAAA India Alternatives on ₹1,000 Crore Investme